@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@
+# Vercel AI SDK preparation boundaries
+
+Treat `prepareCall` as a call-level static-inspection boundary: the effective instructions, output schema, and tools require runtime evidence. Treat `prepareStep` as a per-step instruction boundary when it returns replacement instructions; statically visible input schemas, output schemas, and tool registrations remain independently inspectable.
